  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Collective Climate Action Strategy in Preparation for the COP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Justice and Natural Resource Rights (CJNRR) is in the process of producing a comprehensive vulnerability profile of Bangladesh in consultation with a few other climate action -oriented organizations and think tanks. We would like to present this climate profiling and build climate action collective strategy through a nationwide consortium by March 2024. A part of this activity is also to present the initial outcome of the exercise at COP 28.</narrative>
  </description>
